    pozitif: "When you bring this energy into balance, you gain the ability to build a strong and stable structure in your life. Your leadership quality emerges naturally; you make your decisions clearly and with responsibility, displaying a guiding bearing that gives those around you a sense of trust. You can climb the ladder in your career with ease, successfully carrying the responsibilities you take on.<br><br>When you adopt this outlook, your relationship with money and resources also solidifies: you manage it in an organized, disciplined and wise way; you both protect and grow what you earn. When you use authority as a means of protection and providing security rather than as a tool of pressure, you create a safe ground for everyone, both at work and at home. Thanks to your generosity and your organizational skills, while supporting those in need you also build your own material security on solid foundations.<br><br>When you bring this into your life, your outer world reflects this stability: a solid career, a steady income, a reliable bearing... and all of it feels not like a strain, but like a natural authority."
