    pozitif: "When you bring this energy into balance, your knowledge and experience turn into a real asset. Thanks to your ability to share what you have learned with others, to guide them, and to be a trusted authority, you earn both respect and material reward; fields like consulting, teaching or mentoring can become a natural gateway to income for you.<br><br>When you adopt this outlook, your respect for rules and order brings you stability: you run your work in a solid, reliable and consistent way, and you are known among the people around you as an honest and trustworthy person. As you stay open to new knowledge and keep learning, your career keeps growing too; as you share generously what you know, both your reputation and your material opportunities multiply.<br><br>When you bring this into your life, you build an orderly, respected and sustainable career; your knowledge comes back to you both as peace and as abundance."
