    negatif: "The number 9 energy in your birth year (the Hermit) can, at times, make it hard for you to accept material abundance and money. Deep down you may see simplicity and contentment with little as a virtue, and so sometimes choose the cheapest and most accessible option, hesitating to offer yourself more. You may inwardly criticize people who manage money well or earn it comfortably, and perhaps because of this, unconsciously limit your own abundance.<br><br>Your need for solitude can sometimes distance you from opportunities too; instead of making contact with people, partnerships or new collaborations, you may withdraw into your own world, and so miss valuable connections. Insecurity and excessive caution can also make it harder for you to seize the material opportunities that come your way.",
